06:46.840 --> 06:49.120
So let's go and execute this.

06:49.120 --> 06:50.800
So now let's go and check our results.

06:50.800 --> 06:51.040
First.

06:51.080 --> 06:54.080
It's going to go and partition the data by the product ID.

06:54.080 --> 06:57.000
So as you can see we got now here for windows.

06:57.200 --> 06:59.160
Then sort the data by the sales.

06:59.160 --> 07:03.400
So the data are sorted from the lowest to the highest from 10 to 90.

07:03.600 --> 07:05.800
So now what is the first value of the sales.

07:05.900 --> 07:07.500
It is the first row right.

07:07.700 --> 07:08.820
So it's going to be ten.

07:08.860 --> 07:10.860
That's why we have everywhere a ten.

07:10.900 --> 07:12.060
Let's check another one.

07:12.060 --> 07:13.340
Let's take this one here.

07:13.540 --> 07:16.900
So this window has two rows and it is sorted.

07:16.940 --> 07:20.900
And the lowest sales or let's say the first value is 25.

07:20.900 --> 07:25.420
So that we have solved the first part of the task finding the lowest sales for each product.

07:25.460 --> 07:26.700
Let's go to the next one.

07:26.700 --> 07:29.460
We have to find out the highest sales for each product.

07:29.660 --> 07:32.380
So let's go and use the last value for this.

07:32.380 --> 07:33.780
So let's have a new line.

07:34.340 --> 07:38.620
We're going to have a last value again the sales.

07:39.660 --> 07:41.500
Then we're going to go and define the window.

07:41.500 --> 07:43.260
So it's going to be the exact same window.

07:43.260 --> 07:47.140
We have to partition the data by the product ID and order the data by sales.

07:47.380 --> 07:54.500
So let's go and just copy the previous one and let's call it for now highest sales.

07:55.060 --> 07:56.900
So let's go and execute it.

07:56.900 --> 08:00.100
So now if you check the results you will see our issue over here again.

08:00.100 --> 08:00.420
Right.

08:00.420 --> 08:03.180
We are not getting the highest sales for this window.

08:03.220 --> 08:04.540
The highest sales is 90.

08:04.580 --> 08:08.410
