08:19.330 --> 08:23.970
So now let's go and execute this.

08:24.010 --> 08:25.250
So now let's check the result.

08:25.250 --> 08:28.490
As you can see over here we got the highest sales correctly.

08:28.490 --> 08:30.650
So for this window the highest one is 90.

08:31.410 --> 08:34.170
And as well for this window the 60 and so on.

08:34.170 --> 08:37.890
