08:37.890 --> 08:41.450
But now I would like to show you my honest opinion about this tasks.

08:41.690 --> 08:45.490
I will not go and use the last value to find the highest sales.

08:45.490 --> 08:47.530
So let me show you how I usually do it.

08:47.570 --> 08:51.850
I'm going to go and use the first value in order to find the last value.

08:51.850 --> 08:53.330
So now let me show you what I mean.

08:53.370 --> 08:55.010
Let's go and add a new row.

08:55.850 --> 08:59.330
I will just take the whole thing from the lowest sales.

08:59.450 --> 09:02.450
