09:56.950 --> 10:01.070
So let me just take the same and have a new one.

10:01.070 --> 10:05.750
The lowest sales we can go and say you know what, let's get the min.

10:05.750 --> 10:11.460
So we are saying find me the minimum sales and we don't have to go and sort anything so we can go and

10:11.460 --> 10:12.780
just divide it like this.

10:13.100 --> 10:17.020
So let's give it another ID, let's go and execute it.

10:17.020 --> 10:21.340
So as you can see we got the exact same results like the other two highest sales.

10:21.500 --> 10:24.980
So as you can see we can solve this task using three different functions.

10:25.180 --> 10:27.340
Either go and use the last value.

10:27.340 --> 10:29.140
But you have to define the frame.

10:29.140 --> 10:35.660
