10:38.260 --> 10:43.300
So guys, as you can see, we can use the first value and the last value in order to find out the extremes,

10:43.300 --> 10:46.660
like here in this example, the lowest and the highest sales.

10:46.660 --> 10:50.620
So there is like similarity between those two functions and as well the min and max.

10:50.780 --> 10:55.620
And of course what we're going to do with this value over here, we can go and compare it with the current

10:55.620 --> 10:56.180
sales.

10:56.180 --> 11:01.460
So for example, we can go and extend our task where we say find the difference in sales between the

