11:49.240 --> 11:54.120
So now for the next one the distance between this value and the lowest value is shorter.

11:54.120 --> 11:56.400
So we are near the lowest value.

11:56.400 --> 12:02.560
So as you can see over here we can now compare the sales between the current sales and one extreme in

12:02.560 --> 12:05.640
